WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:07.042
The class video now rides with you: YouTube, locked to the ride clock.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.197
At seven minutes, with a twelve-second offset, the video is at seven twelve. The

00:00:15.197 --> 00:00:17.385
clock leads; the video follows.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:25.539
The player comes from YouTube's privacy-enhanced domain, with no controls, out of

00:00:25.539 --> 00:00:28.013
the tab order. The ride controls it.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.272
Every tick, the drift is checked. More than one and a half seconds either way, and

00:00:35.272 --> 00:00:36.673
the video seeks back.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:46.223
If YouTube is blocked, or the video fails, the cover stays, and a notice says so.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:55.706
The bike still follows the class: the clock reaches seven minutes, and the

00:00:55.706 --> 00:00:57.885
recovery's level goes to the bike.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:07.208
The player lives in its own video library, loaded only when a ride plays its video.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.410
A first view query would have added a kilobyte to the first load, so the frame is

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:17.631
found another way.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.395
In the tests, a fake YouTube player runs on the page's clock, so no request leaves

00:01:27.395 --> 00:01:28.398
the machine.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:37.907
On a phone the video sits above the panel. From laptop width, it fills the column.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:48.034
What the tests prove: four new specs and a table of drift cases, and every check is

00:01:48.034 --> 00:01:48.681
green.

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:58.164
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:58.509 --> 00:02:03.021
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:04.692
every hill and interval.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:10.215
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:10.215 --> 00:02:15.663
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:18.653
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:21.491
A custom workout lives under Profile.
